  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The probability that Ajay will not appear in exam is, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The probability that Ajay and Vijay will appear in exam is, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>V</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>V</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>V</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The probability that Ajay will appear and Vijay will not appear in the exam is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mpadded voffset=\"-1px\"><mi>V</mi></mpadded><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
